+"""Hermes CRM subsystem.
+
+This package hosts the unified CRM backbone: identity, RBAC, metadata
+(collections), the interaction log, and (in later phases) the ported kacrm
+record stores (accounts / contacts / leads / …). It runs against a dedicated
+PostgreSQL database (default ``hermes_crm_dev``) that is independent from the
+existing hermes-cloud SQLite stores.
+
+Public entry points:
+
+- :mod:`hermes.crm.db`         — connection pool + ``DbWrapper``
+- :mod:`hermes.crm.models`     — table-gateway classes
+- :mod:`hermes.crm.routes`     — FastAPI routers mounted under ``/crm``
+"""
