+"""Table-gateway models for the CRM subsystem.
+
+Each module here mirrors kacrm's ``app/models/*_db.py`` one-to-one. The goal
+is to keep the porting story simple: queries, method names, and semantics
+match the kacrm originals, with only the MySQL → PostgreSQL quirks adjusted.
+"""
