+"""KaCRM-flavored tips shown at messaging session start (/new).
+
+Unlike :mod:`hermes_cli.tips` (the upstream coding-agent corpus used by the
+CLI startup banner), these tips speak to KaCRM CRM end users on messaging
+surfaces — WeChat, Feishu, DingTalk, WeCom — and describe what the KaCRM
+agent can actually do for them.
+
+Bilingual: the gateway resolves the active language via
+``agent.i18n.get_language()`` and passes it to :func:`get_kacrm_tip`, so the
+tip language matches the "✦ Tip:" prefix already localized in locales/*.yaml.
+Any non-Chinese locale falls back to English.
+"""
+
+import random
+
+
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Tip corpus — KaCRM CRM capabilities phrased for messaging end users.
+# Keep the two lists mirrored: each zh entry should have an en counterpart.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
