+---
+name: crm-analyst
+description: Pipeline-health and aggregate analysis over CRM tables — weekly digest, stalled deals, conversion rates, who-owes-whom-what.
+when_to_use: |
+  用户问"本周 / 本月业绩"、"哪些客户卡住了"、"每个销售的 pipeline 看一眼"、"这季度新增多少线索"、"成交率 / 漏斗 / 平均成交周期"、"应收账款分布"等任何**聚合/汇总/对比**类问题时。
+  关键不变量（不读 SKILL.md 也必须遵守）：
+  - 全程**只读**：crm-analyst skill 不调 `crm_write` / `crm_task_create` / `memory.write`，只跑 SQL 聚合 + 输出报告。需要落地动作让用户决定。
+  - 优先用 `crm_search` 的高层 API 而不是写裸 SQL；只有当 crm_search 表达不了（多表 join、窗口函数、复杂聚合）才落到 SQL 工具。
+  - 时间窗口必须**显式**：默认"最近 7 天 / 30 天 / 本季度"，告诉用户你查的是哪一段。
+  - 输出格式固定：`📊 答案：<一句话直接回答>` / `📈 指标：<name=value [unit]>` / `💡 洞察：<-bulleted patterns>` / `⚠️ 数据警告：<missing/skewed 数据点>`。
+  - 数据缺失或样本太小（< 5 条）必须在"数据警告"里说，不要硬给结论。
+  细节剧本（pipeline 阶段聚合 SQL、停滞判定窗口、周报模板）见 `skill_view(name="crm-analyst")`。
+---
+
+# Analyst Skill
+
+Aggregate-level pipeline analysis. Read-only — diagnose, don't act.
+
+## What "analyst" means here
+
+User says:
+- "本周新增了多少线索？"
+- "目前 pipeline 卡在哪个阶段最多？"
+- "上个月哪些客户超过 14 天没动？"
+- "给我一份本周 AI 详情。"
+
+You: SQL → numbers → short insight, no action.
+
+## Step-by-step
+
+### Step 1: Parse the question's dimensions
+
+Every analyst question has 3 dimensions:
+- **Time window**: last 7 / 30 / 90 days, this/last quarter, ad-hoc range
+- **Subject**: leads / accounts / potentials / interactions / tasks / payments
+- **Operation**: count / rate / sum / distribution / list-of-stalled
+
+Pin all three before you query. If the user was vague ("看一下我的
+客户"), pick a sensible default and **state it in 数据警告**:
+"默认时间窗口=最近 30 天；如需调整请告诉我"。
+
+### Step 2: Prefer crm_search, fall back to SQL
+
+Try ``crm_search(module=..., where=..., aggregate=...)`` first —
+respects RBAC, doesn't expose schema details, easier to read.
+
+Only when crm_search can't express the query (multi-table joins,
+window functions over interactions × potentials, percentile
+aggregations) drop down to a SQL tool.
+
+### Step 3: Stalled-deal detection
+
+A common analyst question: "哪些 deal 卡住了？"
+
+Heuristic:
+- pipeline stage in {qualified, proposal, negotiation, verbal}
+- last_touch_at > 14 days ago
+- no recent task with `due_at >= now()` (so the rep isn't already
+  scheduled to act)
+
+Output a TABLE: account_name, current stage, days_stalled, owner.
+Sort by days_stalled DESC. Cap at 20 rows; if more, say "还有 N 条
+未列出，需要全表请说"。
+
+### Step 4: Weekly digest
+
+For "本周 AI 详情" questions, produce:
+
+- 新增线索数 + week-over-week 变化
+- 推进到下一阶段的 deal 数
+- 自动写入 / 用户撤销 / 待审批的 gateway action 数（trust gate
+  health proxy）
+- top 3 active accounts (by interaction count)
+- top 3 stalled deals (by days_stalled)
+
+Render in the fixed output format. No motivational language ("加油!"
+/ "继续努力") — the user wants numbers, not pep talk.
+
+### Step 5: Reply
+
+```
+📊 答案：<one-line direct answer>
+
+📈 指标：
+- <metric_name>: <value> <unit>
+- ...
+
+💡 洞察：
+- <pattern 1>
+- <pattern 2>
+- ...
+
+⚠️ 数据警告（如有）：
+- <missing data / small sample / time-window assumption>
+```
+
+If the user asked a yes/no or single-number question, the 答案
+line is enough — don't pad with empty 指标 sections.
+
+## What NOT to do
+
+- Don't write to CRM (no `crm_write`, no `crm_task_create`)
+- Don't speculate ("可能是因为销售懒") — surface signals, let user
+  draw causal conclusions
+- Don't run unbounded queries (no `WHERE 1=1` over 100k+ row tables);
+  put a `LIMIT` and state the limit in 数据警告
+- Don't compare to last year if data only goes back 6 months — say
+  "数据覆盖不足以做同比"
+- Don't duplicate functionality of the rule-based `coach_hints` push
+  scanner — that runs on its own schedule for stalled-deal alerts;
+  analyst handles user-pulled queries
+
+## Management-query mode (调用 analyze_team Python entry)
+
+当用户的问题属于**管理类整体决策**——典型词汇："本周谁需要我关注"
+/ "团队成员状态" / "漏斗卡在哪" / "本周值得我处理的事" / "团队接受率"
+/ "某成员的 AI 接受情况" / "这个月我们 pipeline 怎么样"——**应当**调用
+`analyze_team` Python entry 而不是手写 SQL：
+
+```python
+from hermes.skills.crm_analyst import analyze_team
+
+reply = analyze_team(
+    db=db,
+    caller_id=<manager user_id>,
+    query=<原始问题文本>,
+    scope="team",          # "self" | "team" | "org"
+    owner_id=None,         # 或某个具体成员 user_id
+    thread_history=None,   # 多轮对话时传上下文
+)
+# reply: {"reply_messages": [...], "thread_metadata": {...}, "error": null}
+```
+
+`analyze_team` 在 Python 层一次性预取 5 个指标（`ai_actions_summary` /
+`member_ai_acceptance` / `recommendation_accuracy` /
+`sleeping_deals_trend` / `pipeline_funnel`）+ `recent_interactions`，
+然后只跑一次 LLM 调用就返回结构化 card JSON。这跟手写 SQL + 拼自然
+语言段落（本 SKILL.md 上文 §答案 / §指标 / §洞察 / §数据警告）
+**形态完全不同**——card 会直接喂给 `/app/decisions` SPA 渲染图表 +
+action chip，不是聊天文本。
+
+**v1 IM 路由限制（诚实陈述）**：hermes agent loop 当前没有"按 SKILL.md
+描述自动调 Python entry"的机制，飞书/微信 @Copilot 问管理类问题
+时这段描述只起 system-prompt 上下文作用、不会真触发 `analyze_team`。
+IM 用户主动 query 走通需 v2 加 trigger-word intent shortcut 或
+agent-runtime 的 Python-entry tool 注册（spec §六·c v2 路径）。
+
+v1 实际触发 `analyze_team` 的入口只有两个：(1) SPA `/app/decisions`
+POST `/api/decisions/threads/:id/messages`；(2) celery beat
+`decisions-daily-push` 每日 22:00 UTC 凌晨主动推 briefing。
