+# CRM DB Access Reference
+
+## Connection
+
+```
+psql "${HERMES_CRM_DATABASE_URL}"
+```
+
+**Auth:** use the database role and credentials configured for your environment.
+**Host:** localhost port 5432, database `hermes_crm_dev`.
+
+> Note: `psycopg2` is NOT available in execute_code sandbox — use `terminal` + psql CLI directly.
+
+## Table Schemas (non-obvious columns)
+
+| Table | PK | Non-obvious FK / Status columns |
+|-------|----|-----|
+| `potentials` | `potentials_id` | `milestone` (stage), `closingdate`, `amount`, `accounts_id`, `contacts_id` |
+| `tasks` | `tasks_id` | `status` ('open'), `due_at` (timestamptz), `related_module`, `related_record_id`, `source_agent` |
+| `leads` | `leads_id` | `mobile`, `contact`, `source`, `status`, `remarks`, `convertedstatus` |
+| `accounts` | `accounts_id` | `mobile`, `email`, `latest_progress`, `next_contact_date` |
+| `interactions` | `id` (uuid) | `kind`, `occurred_at`, `content` (jsonb), `subjects` (jsonb) |
+| `gateway_actions` | `id` (uuid) | `kind`, `target` (jsonb), `params` (jsonb), `state`, `created_at`, `origin` |
+
+## Key Query Templates
+
+### Active potentials (non-closed)
+```sql
+SELECT p.potentials_id, p.potentials_name, p.milestone, p.closingdate, p.amount, p.created_at
+FROM potentials p
+WHERE p.deleted = false AND p.milestone NOT IN ('closed_won','closed_lost')
+ORDER BY p.created_at DESC LIMIT 20;
+```
+
+### Overdue/open tasks
+```sql
+SELECT t.tasks_id, t.tasks_name, t.related_module, t.related_record_id, t.status, t.due_at::text, t.source_agent
+FROM tasks t
+WHERE t.deleted = false AND t.due_at::date <= CURRENT_DATE AND t.status = 'open'
+ORDER BY t.due_at LIMIT 20;
+```
+
+### Recent leads (last 7 days)
+```sql
+SELECT l.leads_id, l.leads_name, l.mobile, l.contact, l.source, l.status, l.created_at::text
+FROM leads l
+WHERE l.deleted = false AND l.created_at::date > CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '7 days'
+ORDER BY l.created_at DESC;
+```
+
+### Coach proposal history (7 days)
+```sql
+SELECT ga.id, ga.target, ga.params, ga.state, ga.created_at::text
+FROM gateway_actions ga
+WHERE ga.kind = 'coach.proposal' AND ga.created_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '7 days'
+ORDER BY ga.created_at DESC LIMIT 30;
+```
+
+### Recent interactions (last 7 days)
+```sql
+SELECT i.id, i.kind, i.occurred_at::text, i.content, i.subjects
+FROM interactions i
+WHERE i.occurred_at::date > CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '7 days'
+ORDER BY i.occurred_at DESC LIMIT 20;
+```
+
+## Milestone / Stage Values
+
+`potentials.milestone` values: `initial_contact`, `needs_analysis`, `qualified`, `proposal_sent`, `negotiation`, `verbal`, `closed_won`, `closed_lost`
+
+## Tasks Status Values
+
+`tasks.status`: `'open'` (string, not enum)
+
+## Gateway Action State Values
+
+`gateway_actions.state`: `pending_approval`, `approved`, `blocked`, `rejected`, `executed`, `reverted`, `conflict`
