+---
+name: crm-intake
+description: Extract CRM-updatable signals (people, companies, contact info, opportunities) from incoming text and persist via crm_write / crm_task_create / memory.
+when_to_use: 用户提到新客户/新公司/初次接触/互加微信/留名片/首次会议/新人名+公司名/刚结束销售拜访——任何"刚刚发生/我了解到"的业务信号要落进 CRM 时。写入前必读本技能(内含身份铁律/picklist 三步/不虚报铁律等关键不变量)。
+---
+
+# CRM Intake Skill
+
+Turn unstructured text (chat messages, voice notes transcribed,
+meeting recap) into structured CRM rows + memory entries + follow-up
+tasks.
+
+## 关键不变量(铁律,先读后写)
+
+- **当前记录身份铁律**（SPA Copilot 在记录详情页打开时):system message 第一段会给出"用户当前在 X 模块的记录 #N 页面上,该记录核心字段:..."。**这条 system 摘要是真理**——记录的客户名、阶段、金额以摘要为准,**绝不准凭对话历史/模型记忆/上一段对话出现过的别的客户名去推断**。摘要里没列出的字段,需要时调 `crm_get(module, id)` 实时拉,不要瞎猜。新建关联记录(商机/订单/任务)时,如果父记录已由 system 指明,直接用摘要里的 ID + 客户名,不要反问"是哪个客户"。例:system 说"accounts#498 客户名称=贵阳来顺贸易公司",用户说"杨总要 3 套",你建商机就写 `accounts_id=498, accounts_name="贵阳来顺贸易公司"`,**不要**蹦出别的客户名。
+- 默认写**一条 leads 行**：`leads_name`=公司名（required），`contact`=联系人姓名，`mobile`/`phone`/`email`=联系方式，`source`=渠道（微信/展会/...）。**不要**同时拆出 accounts+contacts，除非用户明说"建档"或已成交。
+- 写之前**必须** `crm_get_schema(module="leads")` 读 required 字段，用真实列名（如 `leads_name` 而非 `name`）。
+- 用户输入缺 required 字段时**问用户**，不编造手机号/邮箱/地址。
+- 提到时间承诺（"周一来访"/"明天回电"）→ 同步调 `crm_task_create(due_at=..., related_module="leads", related_record_id=<刚写入的 id>)`。
+- **picklist 字段**（`source` / `industry` / ...）用户给的值不在合法选项内时——三步，缺一不可：
+  1. **落地记录，不要因 picklist 不全而拒写**：该 picklist 若有 `other`/`unknown` 之类中性选项就用它兜底；**若没有中性选项，就把这个字段留空（其余字段照常写入）——绝不把值硬塞成一个语义不符的兄弟值**（例：用户说"微信"，`source` 只有 `feishu` → 留空 `source`，不要写成 `feishu`）。`crm_write` 若直接对该 picklist 返回 `__CLARIFY__`，是同一种情况：按本规则用中性值或留空重写；**intake 新建记录时不要调 `clarify` 工具**（那是更新已有记录的处理方式）。
+  2. **必须调 `crm_propose_picklist_option(module_name, field_name, value, label, reason)` 提议加新值**——`value` 用 snake_case 英文键，`label` 用用户原话。例：用户说"TikTok 直播来的" → `crm_propose_picklist_option(module_name="leads", field_name="source", value="tiktok_live", label="TikTok 直播", reason="本周已碰到 2 条 TikTok 直播线索，建议加入 source 选项")`。
+  3. **回复用户时，提议那句话逐字复制工具返回结果里的 `user_message` 字段**（形如"已向管理员提交提议 #N…"）。
+- **🚫 不虚报铁律**：只有当你在**本轮**真的调用过 `crm_propose_picklist_option` / `crm_propose_new_field` 并拿到带 `proposal_id` + `user_message` 的**成功**结果时，回复里才可以出现"提议""提议 #N""已向 admin 提议"等字样，且必须逐字用 `user_message`。**没调用过工具就绝不能提"提议"二字，更不准凭记忆/凭上一条线索编一个提议编号。** 漏调了就老老实实只说记录已落地、来源暂空。**这条铁律对所有工具动作通用**——`memory(action="remove")` 清理记忆、`crm_write`、`crm_task_create` 同理:只有本轮真的调用过该工具、且拿到成功结果,才能在回复里声称做过它("已清理/已删除/已记录/已录入")。把"打算做""应该做"写成"已做",就是虚报。
+- **brand-new 字段**（用户提到 schema 没有的**结构化业务属性**——如"客户的合规等级 / 采购周期 / 决策链层级 / 预算范围 / 合作意向度"等可分类、可筛选、可统计的字段，**不是临时备注**）：**第一次遇到就调** `crm_propose_new_field(module_name, field_name, field_label, field_type, reason)` 提议——不要等"反复提到"才动手，也不要先把它塞进 `remarks/notes/memory` 当文本敷衍。同样进 admin 审核队列，**不要**自己直接 `crm_write` 一个不存在的字段，**也受上面「不虚报铁律」约束**。判断标准:这个属性以后会不会被用来"筛选客户 / 做报表 / 触发流程"?会 → propose 字段;只是这次对话的注解 → 写 memory 即可。
+- **brand-new 模块**（用户提到的业务对象不属于现有模块 leads/accounts/contacts/potentials/tasks，例如"售后工单 / 合同 / 报价单 / 退货单"）：**不要**硬塞进现有模块，也**不要** propose 新字段去模拟。直接告诉用户："这是一个新的业务对象，需要在 admin 后台新建模块，我目前不能自动建模块。" 同时可写一条 memory 记录这个需求，方便后续 admin 回顾。
+
+## What "intake" means
+
+User says: "今天微信加了瑞昌贸易公司张三，13800138000，他们对 3DMax
+软件感兴趣，想周一来访"
+
+You:
+1. Parse out the entities (lead "张三", company "瑞昌贸易公司",
+   phone, interest, scheduled visit)
+2. Create CRM rows for the entities (call ``crm_write``)
+3. Save salient context that doesn't fit a CRM column to the lead's
+   CRM timeline (``crm_note_create`` / ``crm_memory_write``) — NOT to
+   the ``memory`` notebook
+4. If a follow-up time was mentioned, create a task (call
+   ``crm_task_create``)
+5. Tell the user what you did, with the new record IDs
+
+## Step-by-step
+
+### Step 1: Discover the schema
+
+Don't assume CRM module names or field names. Call:
+
+- ``crm_list_modules()`` — to see what modules exist (leads /
+  accounts / contacts / potentials / ...)
+- ``crm_get_schema(module=X)`` — to see the columns for the module
+  you'll write to
+
+This is a one-time read at the start of a session; the agent caches
+the schema mentally for the rest of the conversation.
+
+### Step 2: Pick the right module
+
+The leads table represents a **prospective customer / business
+opportunity**. The row's main subject is the **company / org**, not
+the individual.
+
+- ``leads`` row = a prospective customer org. Field semantics:
+   - ``leads_name`` = **company name** (主体). Required.
+   - ``contact`` = **contact person's name** (联系人). NOT required
+     by schema, but in practice always fill it when known.
+   - ``mobile`` / ``phone`` / ``email`` = that person's contact details
+   - ``source`` = where the lead came from (微信 / 展会 / 推荐 / ...)
+- ``accounts`` row = a customer org you already do business with.
+  ``accounts_name`` is the company name.
+- ``contacts`` row = a known person at an existing account.
+  ``contacts_name`` is the person's name.
+- ``potentials`` row = a specific deal / project / opportunity.
+- ``salesorders`` row = a signed sales order (合同/订单). **必须**在
+  创建时同时提供金额信号,二选一:
+   - ``products`` 行项数组(优先,自动 rollup 出 ``final_amount``):
+     ``data={"salesorders_name": ..., "accounts_id": ...,
+     "products": [{"products_id": 12, "quantity": 2, "price": 1500,
+     "tax_rate": 13}, ...]}``
+   - 直接传 ``final_amount`` 数字(没有产品行项时的兜底):
+     ``data={..., "final_amount": 47400}``
+  **空壳订单(没 products 也没 final_amount)会被拒收** —
+  ``accounts.deal_amount`` / ``deal_count`` 触发器只统计
+  ``final_amount > 0`` 且 ``status ∈ {confirmed, delivered,
+  completed}`` 的订单。把金额只写到下游 ``receivables.dueamount``、
+  父订单留空,客户面板会显示 0 成交。
+
+When user mentions "今天加了 XX 公司 YY 的微信" (new outreach):
+- Default: ONE ``leads`` row with ``leads_name=<company>`` +
+  ``contact=<person>`` + ``mobile=<phone>``. **Don't split** into a
+  separate account + lead unless the user explicitly asks to convert.
+- Only create an ``accounts`` row if the lead has matured (signed
+  deal, recurring engagement).
+
+### Step 3: Required + optional fields
+
+Read the schema. The required fields shown by ``crm_get_schema`` MUST
+be filled. Optional fields fill only when present in the user input.
+
+If the user input is missing a required field (e.g., user only gave
+the name, not the phone), **ask the user** rather than fabricate.
+Don't make up phone numbers / emails / addresses.
+
+### Step 4: Write to CRM
+
+Call ``crm_write(module=..., action="create", data={...})`` with the
+real column names from the schema (don't use friendly aliases like
+"name" — use ``leads_name`` / ``accounts_name`` per the schema).
+
+If the response is ``success=true`` you get back an ``id`` — keep it
+to mention in your reply.
+
+If ``pending_approval=true`` the write is queued for human review;
+don't retry, just acknowledge.
+
+If the write returns ``__CLARIFY__`` because a **picklist** value
+isn't in the option list, this is the unknown-picklist case from the
+invariants above — you are creating a NEW record, so do NOT call the
+``clarify`` tool. Re-issue ``crm_write`` with a neutral fallback
+(``other``/``unknown`` if the field has one) or with that field
+omitted, then call ``crm_propose_picklist_option``. The ``clarify``
+flow in the crm-validation-error skill is for **updating existing
+records**, not intake.
+
+### Step 5: 把上下文存进 CRM —— 不要写进 memory 便签
+
+线索本身在 Step 4 已写入 CRM，**不要**再把它抄一份进 ``memory``
+工具。``memory``（MEMORY.md）是一个 2,200 字符的小便签，每轮都整段
+注入 system prompt —— 它是 agent / 用户级事实的笔记本，**不是线索
+台账**，往里塞记录会很快撑爆。
+
+不适合 CRM 字段的“客户洞察”，按性质二选一：
+
+- 一次具体的观察、决定、客户口头表态、约定的下一步
+  → ``crm_note_create(module="leads", record_id=<id>, text=...)``，
+  落到该线索的时间线上。
+- 一条提炼过、以后值得被检索到的耐久事实（公司背景、决策链等）
+  → ``crm_memory_write(content=..., related_module="leads",
+  related_record_id=<id>)``，进入可语义检索的记忆底座。
+
+两者都是 Postgres 支撑、无容量上限。``memory`` 工具只留给极少数
+**跨对话的 agent / 用户级事实**（用户偏好、环境怪癖）—— intake
+流程正常情况下根本不该调用它。
+
+### Step 6: Schedule follow-up if user mentioned a time
+
+If the user said "周一来访" / "下周回电" / "明天上午跟进", call
+``crm_task_create(title=..., due_at=..., related_module="leads",
+related_record_id=<id from step 4>)``.
+
+``crm_task_create`` internally schedules a cronjob, so the user gets a
+push reminder at the due time AND the task shows up on the SPA Tasks
+page.
+
+### Step 7: Reply to user
+
+Format:
+```
+✅ 已录入 CRM:
+- **线索 (公司)**: <leads_name> (#<leads_id>)
+- **联系人**: <contact> — <mobile / phone / email>
+- **来源 / 备注**: <source> / <remarks>
+
+📝 备注: <crm_note_create / crm_memory_write 实际写入的内容>
+
+⏰ 跟进任务: <title> @ <due_at> (#<task_id>)
+
+🗳️ 提议: <crm_propose_* 工具返回的 user_message 原文>
+```
+
+The 🗳️ line appears **only if** you actually called
+``crm_propose_picklist_option`` / ``crm_propose_new_field`` this turn
+and got a success result — paste its ``user_message`` verbatim. No
+tool call this turn → omit the line entirely. NEVER hand-write a
+"提议 #N" sentence; the only legitimate source of that wording is a
+real tool result. Fabricating a proposal you didn't file misleads the
+user and the admin review queue.
+
+The 📝 备注 line appears **only if** you actually called
+``crm_note_create`` or ``crm_memory_write`` this turn and got a
+success result — otherwise omit it entirely. Same 不虚报 rule: never
+write a 📝 备注 line for a note you did not persist.
+
+If anything failed or needed approval, say so explicitly — don't
+hide it.
+
+## What NOT to do
+
+- Don't fabricate field values (phone, email, company size) when not
+  in user input
+- Don't pre-fill ``status="qualified"`` or other workflow flags —
+  user will set those later
+- Don't auto-write a task without a stated time / commitment
+- Don't write the same row twice if user repeats the message — check
+  ``crm_search`` first if uncertain
+- Don't skip the schema read step ("just guess the column names") —
+  this is the leading cause of write failures
+- **Don't claim a proposal exists unless you filed it this turn.**
+  Saying "已向 admin 提议加微信选项（提议 #N）" without a matching
+  ``crm_propose_picklist_option`` call this turn is a fabrication —
+  the row never lands in ``field_proposals`` and the admin never sees
+  it. The proposal id and wording must come straight from the tool's
+  ``user_message``.
+- Don't coerce an unknown picklist value into an unrelated sibling
+  value (微信 → feishu). Leave the field empty and file a proposal.
+
+## Correcting mistaken attribution
+
+When the user points out a wrong-company attribution ("这个不是 X 公司，是 Y 公司"):
+
+1. **Don't delete the wrong record** — the wrong record (X) may still
+   be valid for the context it was originally created for.
+2. **Add a corrective note to X**: use ``crm_note_create`` to state
+   "上一条关于 [subject] 的记录误归至此客户，实际属于 Y 公司".
+3. **Create or update Y's record** with the correct information, then
+   add the communication note to Y's record.
+4. **Confirm both operations** in your reply — tell the user what was
+   fixed on X and what was created/updated on Y, with record IDs.
