+---
+name: crm-research
+description: Background research on a customer / company / person — gather facts from memory, CRM history, and web, then persist salient findings to memory.
+when_to_use: |
+  用户说"查一下 XX 公司 / XX 这个人"、"了解一下这个客户的背景"、"他们做什么业务"、"这个项目以前聊过什么"，或主 agent 自己判断"我对这条线索一无所知，先调研再回答"时。
+  一次要调研**多个**独立目标(「这几家竞品都查一下」/「A、B、C 对比」)→ 见正文
+  「一次多个目标 → 并行调研」,为每个目标发一个后台 `delegate_task` 并行跑、最后
+  汇总对比,**不要串行一个个查**。
+  关键不变量（不读 SKILL.md 也必须遵守）：
+  - 调研顺序固定三步：(1) `crm_semantic_search` 查内部历史 → (2) `crm_search` 看 leads/accounts/contacts/interactions 里既有记录 → (3) 如果 1+2 都不够，再上 web_search 拉公开资料。**不要**直接 web_search 跳过内部数据。
+  - 每条 web 来源必须带 URL；编造来源 = 严重违规。
+  - 调研结果要 **持久化到 memory**：调用 `crm_memory_write` 把要点（公司主营、规模、采购周期、决策人、最近动态）写进去，下次同主题查询用 `crm_semantic_search` 就能命中。
+  - 输出格式固定：`📋 摘要：<≤200 字结论>` / `🔎 要点：<-bulleted facts>` / `🌐 来源：<URL list>` / `🗂 已写入 memory：<n 条>`。
+  - 时效敏感的事实（"最近一轮融资 / 现任 CEO"）要写明日期；过期了用户能识别。
+  细节剧本（entity graph 一跳扩展、co-mention 解析、查不到时如何降级）见 `skill_view(name="crm-research")`。
+---
+
+# Research Skill
+
+Turn an entity name (company / person / project) into a grounded
+briefing the user can act on. Pure information gathering — never
+write CRM rows, never send messages.
+
+## 一次多个目标 → 并行调研(delegate_task fan-out)
+
+当用户一次要求调研 **2 个及以上**独立实体(「帮我调研这 5 个竞品」/「把这批
+客户都摸一遍」/「A、B、C 三家对比一下」),**不要串行一个个查**——为每个实体
+发起一个后台 `delegate_task` 并行跑,最后收敛成一份对比简报:
+
+1. 把请求拆成实体清单(逐个名字)。
+2. **一次性**为每个实体发起 `delegate_task`,`background=true`(不阻塞当前对话),
+   任务描述固定为:「按 crm-research 协议调研 `<实体>`:内部优先(crm_semantic_search
+   → crm_search)→ entity graph 一跳 → 只在有缺口时 web 兜底;输出 摘要/要点/来源,
+   并用 `crm_memory_write` 持久化要点」。把这批 delegate_task 全部发出后再等。
+3. 全部子任务完成后,它们的结果会作为**一条合并回合**回来;你把它收敛成:
+   - 每个实体一段 `📋 摘要` + `🔎 要点` + `🌐 来源`
+   - 结尾加一段**横向对比**:规模 / 主营 / 采购信号,谁更值得优先跟进
+   - 一行 `🗂 已写入 memory:<总条数>`
+4. **判据**:实体数 ≥ 2 且彼此独立 → 并行 fan-out;若有依赖(「先查 A,再根据 A 的
+   结果决定查谁」)→ 退回串行,按下面 Step 1–4 逐个做。单个目标的常规请求也走
+   Step 1–4,不必为一个实体起 delegate。
+
+## Step-by-step
+
+### Step 1: Internal-first
+
+Before touching the web, exhaust internal sources:
+
+- ``crm_semantic_search`` with the entity name as query — pulls anything
+  this user has previously noted about this customer / industry
+- ``crm_search`` on leads, accounts, contacts, interactions, notes
+  with the entity name — surfaces "we already talked to them in
+  Feb" / "they're in the CRM as a stalled deal"
+
+If internal data is sufficient (e.g., the user just forgot what
+they noted last quarter), STOP HERE and reply with the internal
+findings. Don't burn web_search quota.
+
+### Step 2: Entity graph one hop
+
+For a company entity, also pull:
+- co-mentioned people (contacts whose `accounts_id` = this account)
+- co-mentioned deals (potentials whose `account_id` = this account)
+- recent interactions across all those linked records
+
+This often surfaces "Oh, Lily already met their CTO last month" —
+context the user lost track of.
+
+### Step 3: Web fill-in
+
+Only when steps 1+2 leave material gaps:
+
+- ``web_search`` with the entity name + the missing dimension
+  ("XX 公司 主营业务" / "XX 公司 融资" / "YY CEO 背景")
+- For each fact you cite, keep the source URL. The output's 来源
+  section makes verification cheap for the user.
+
+Privacy: never look up a private individual's home address,
+personal phone, family info — only public business context (LinkedIn,
+company press releases, news coverage).
+
+### Step 3b: Web fallback when search engines block
+
+If ``web_search`` (Google/DDG/Bing) returns nothing or hits CAPTCHA/bot
+detection (common in headless environments), fall back to structured
+APIs that are reliably accessible:
+
+- **Wikipedia REST API** — best for established companies/people:
+  - `https://en.wikipedia.org/api/rest_v1/page/summary/<Entity>` —
+    returns JSON with extract, URL for 1-paragraph intro
+  - `https://en.wikipedia.org/api/rest_v1/page/html/<Entity>` —
+    full HTML for extracting infobox (CEO, founded, revenue, HQ)
+  - Works without API key, no bot detection. Use Python
+    ``urllib.request`` with a standard UA header.
+  - Reference: ``references/wikipedia-api-research.md`` in this skill
+- **Crunchbase / Reuters / company own site** as direct targets
+  (no intermediate search engine). URL format varies per target.
+
+⚠️ Never fabricate facts when all sources fail — say "未在公开信息中找到" plainly.
+
+### Step 4: Persist to memory
+
+Salient findings go into ``crm_memory_write`` so future queries hit
+warm cache via ``crm_semantic_search``:
+
+- Company main business, size, headquarters
+- Decision-maker name + title
+- Recent material events (funding, leadership change, product launch)
+- Sales-relevant signals (recent layoffs / hiring freeze / new
+  initiative that maps to your product)
+
+Write 1-3 sentence atomic facts as distilled prose — never dump a
+whole web page or raw JSON; the gateway rejects serialized objects.
+When the research is about a CRM record on screen, pass
+``related_module`` + ``related_record_id`` together so the fact
+surfaces on that customer's "系统记得的事" panel. A deal's company
+facts link to the underlying ``accounts`` record, not the deal.
+
+### Step 5: Reply
+
+Fixed format:
+
+```
+📋 摘要：<one paragraph, ≤200 chars>
+
+🔎 要点：
+- <fact 1>
+- <fact 2>
+- ...
+
+🌐 来源：
+- <URL 1> — <one-line description>
+- <URL 2> — ...
+
+🗂 已写入 memory：<n> 条
+```
+
+If web search returned nothing useful, say so plainly:
+`🌐 来源：未在公开信息中找到 XX 公司的相关资料（可能规模较小/中文媒体覆盖少）。`
+
+## What NOT to do
+
+- Don't fabricate facts when web_search misses — say "未找到"
+- Don't reproduce large blocks of source text (copyright + signal-to-noise)
+- Don't write to CRM here — research is read-only; if the user asks
+  to "把这些写进备注", that's crm-intake skill territory
+- Don't skip step 1 — the user's own memory is almost always the
+  most relevant source
+- Don't quote an URL you didn't actually fetch — inventing sources
+  destroys user trust irrecoverably
+
+## 联网调研:web_search(2026-06-22)
+
+第三步"上公开资料"用 `web_search`(经 MiniMax 托管搜索,国内可达、结果稳定)。覆盖公司背景、最新动态、融资/财务/市值、新闻等——直接搜即可,无需区分上市与否。
+
+铁律不变:
+- **每条结论带来源 URL**;编造来源/数字 = 严重违规。
+- **查不到就如实说,绝不编造**。`web_search` 无果 → 直说"未查到",不要凑。
+- 用于 AI 字段(ai_fill)自动填"最新市值/近期动态"这类时同理:能查到带来源写回,查不到 abstain。
