+            "user's intent if the entity/fields are ambiguous. After creating, "
+            "tell the user exactly what you built. Use crm_create_subdetail to "
+            "attach line-item children (product lines / generic detail rows)."
+        ),
+        verb="create",
+        module_name="__schema_module__",
+        input_schema={
